# ==============================================================
# CHILTAN ADVENTURES - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================
# In Google AI Studio Preview and Local Development, the application
# automatically runs in Demo Mode (Local SQLite & Project Assets)
# without requiring any external credentials.
#
# The following environment variables are ONLY required when deploying
# to production on Vercel:
#
# ADMIN_EMAIL=
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=
# SESSION_SECRET=
# DB_HOST=
# DB_PORT=
# DB_NAME=
# DB_USER=
# DB_PASSWORD=
# DATABASE_URL=
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
